lvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯混元发布1.25-bit端侧翻译模型，成功落地B站直播弹幕实时翻译</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">亚马逊追加200万枚英伟达GPU订单，深化全栈AI技术合作</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google升级Gemini Live接入Spark智能代理，实现语音操控Gmail与全家桶</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达发布2027财年半年报：净利1180亿美元并实现Vera Rubin平台量产</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8ba88b9d91febbbc7bd322b257d80990.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达正式公布2027财年半年报，上半年实现营收1778.37亿美元，归母净利润达1180.1亿美元，同比大幅增长161.1%。第二季度单季营收962.21亿美元，同比增长106%，数据中心业务贡献890.23亿美元，同比增长117%。在硬件与技术进展方面，新一代NVIDIA Vera Rubin平台已进入全面量产阶段，首款面向AI智能体的CPU NVIDIA Vera及Groq 3 LPX推理加速器均已投产。此外，英伟达推出NVIDIA Cosmos3及Isaac GR00T人形机器人参考设计，并计划联合金融机构动员超5000亿美元资本支持全球AI基础设施建设。公司预计第三季度营收将达1080亿美元，毛利率维持在74%左右。英伟达通过持续的硬件迭代与生态扩张，进一步巩固了其在AI算力市场的核心主导地位。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达以129亿美元收购开源AI平台Hugging Face</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2842940a916071785fed87a4a0d02918.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达正式宣布以129亿美元收购开源AI平台Hugging Face，该交易价格约为Hugging Face年营收1.5亿美元的80倍。Hugging Face作为托管开源模型及提供云服务的核心平台，在AI开发者生态中占据领先地位。面对OpenAI、Anthropic等闭源厂商通过自研芯片及引入AMD、Cerebras等供应商以降低对英伟达硬件依赖的趋势，英伟达此举旨在通过整合Hugging Face的开源生态，将其打造为类似OpenRouter的开放权重模型枢纽。此次收购不仅能强化英伟达的云业务布局，更通过掌握开源模型分发入口，为其GPU硬件产品锁定关键开发者群体，从而在闭源实验室算力自主化浪潮中，重新巩固其在AI基础设施领域的话语权。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯混元发布1.25-bit端侧翻译模型，成功落地B站直播弹幕实时翻译</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/be4b1431b360d9ee498f60b9a23ac46f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯混元团队近日推出Hy-MT2-1.8B端侧翻译模型极低比特量化方案，成功将模型体积从3.3GB压缩至440MB。该方案包含两档技术：面向中高端设备的2-bit拉伸弹性量化（SEQ）方案，以及面向全系设备的1.25-bit Sherry稀疏高效三值量化方案。通过细粒度稀疏机制与专为CPU设计的STQ内核，模型在保持近乎无损翻译质量的同时，大幅降低了内存占用。此外，英特尔团队针对x86生态进行深度适配，优化了向量化与VNNI指令融合，提升了模型在PC及边缘设备的运行速率。目前，该技术已在哔哩哔哩直播弹幕实时翻译中落地，资源下载包约600MB，运行时内存占用控制在500至700MB，单条弹幕翻译耗时500至800毫秒。此举不仅降低了云端调用成本与带宽开销，还通过本地化运行有效保障了用户隐私安全，实现了从实验室De</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">亚马逊追加200万枚英伟达GPU订单，深化全栈AI技术合作</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9328331fc4efec5c1d3e01c7bac78499.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">亚马逊与英伟达宣布深化战略合作，亚马逊计划在数月前部署超100万枚GPU的基础上，再追加200万枚英伟达GPU订单。该批次涵盖Blackwell Ultra、Rubin及Rubin Ultra架构，预计于2027年至2028年间部署至AWS数据中心。合作不仅限于硬件采购，英伟达全栈技术生态将全面整合进AWS，包括Vera CPU、网络硬件、Omniverse数字孪生平台、Cosmos世界模型、Isaac机器人平台及Jetson边缘计算硬件。此外，AWS的Amazon Bedrock和SageMaker平台将引入英伟达Nemotron系列开源大模型。英伟达为应对持续激增的算力需求，已将供应链与制造能力承诺投入提升至279亿美元。尽管亚马逊持续推进自研Trainium芯片以应对深度学习负载，但此次大规模采购进一步巩</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google升级Gemini Live接入Spark智能代理，实现语音操控Gmail与全家桶</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94144b689fb240822bd21f2db8ddc42c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google近日对Gemini Live进行重大升级，正式接入智能代理系统Spark，推动其从语音对话工具向生产力Agent转型。此次更新核心在于强化跨应用协作，用户可通过语音指令调用Spark，在Google Docs、Sheets、Drive及网页间执行复杂多步骤任务，如自动整理文档大纲或生成采购清单。此外，Gemini Live新增“每日简报”功能，可整合Gmail邮件与Google日历信息进行语音播报。用户现可通过语音直接对Gmail执行搜索、概括、加星标、归档及删除等操作。在上下文理解方面，Gemini Live现能结合Gmail、Photos、搜索及YouTube等服务历史，输出更具个性化的回应。权限方面，使用Spark相关功能需订阅Google AI Pro及以上版本，而“每日简报”功能则要求至少</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
